---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Sidartha Kumar"
  description="How sidarthakumar.com handles website visits, email inquiries, external links, and the services needed to operate this personal portfolio."
  contactBand={false}
>
  <PageHeading eyebrow="SIDARTHA KUMAR" title="Privacy Policy" />
  <article class="container privacy-page prose">
    <p class="small-note">Last updated: 18 October 2026</p>
    <p>
      This is the personal portfolio of Sidartha Kumar at sidarthakumar.com.
      This notice describes the website’s current features and how information
      may be processed when you visit or get in touch.
    </p>
    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>
      Contact links open your email application. If you email{' '}
      <a href="mailto:hello@sidarthakumar.com">hello@sidarthakumar.com</a>, the
      email services involved process your message, address, and any information
      you include. I use correspondence to respond and discuss relevant
      opportunities or projects.
    </p>
    <p>
      This website has no contact-form database, visitor accounts, or public
      comments. Please share only information needed for your inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and technical information</h2>
    <p>
      The website uses Hostinger hosting. Hosting and network infrastructure may
      process technical information such as IP addresses, browser details,
      requested pages, access times, and security events for operation,
      troubleshooting, and abuse prevention. Provider settings and service
      arrangements govern the infrastructure’s logs, backups, retention, and
      processing locations.
    </p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>
      The portfolio’s public pages do not set application cookies or use browser
      storage. This version does not include Google Analytics, advertising
      pixels, behavioural advertising, third-party fonts, or embedded social
      feeds. Hosting infrastructure may apply its own security measures. This
      notice will be updated if the website’s features change.
    </p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      Links to GitHub and other websites take you to services with their own
      privacy practices. The portfolio does not load their embedded content when
      you read a page. Clicking an external link may share normal connection and
      referral information with the destination.
    </p>
    <h2>Retention and sharing</h2>
    <p>
      Email correspondence may be retained as needed to respond, maintain
      relevant records, or meet applicable obligations. Email and hosting
      providers have their own retention settings. I do not sell visitors’
      personal information. Information may be disclosed when legally required
      or necessary to protect the website and its users.
    </p>
    <h2>Requests and contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions or a request relating to information you have
      provided, email{' '}
      <a href="mailto:hello@sidarthakumar.com">hello@sidarthakumar.com</a>.
      Requests will be considered in accordance with applicable requirements.
    </p>
    <h2>Security and changes</h2>
    <p>
      The site uses reasonable safeguards, including HTTPS and restricted
      publishing access. Internet transmission and storage cannot be guaranteed
      completely secure. Changes to the website or service arrangements may
      require an update to this notice.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
